---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="about.title">Chi sono</h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <p class="about-body" data-i18n="about.body">
        Sono Saif Edin Gharsallah, sviluppatore full-stack e studente di Ingegneria Informatica
        all'Università di Palermo. Costruisco applicazioni web end-to-end, dal frontend al backend,
        con attenzione alla qualità del codice e all'esperienza utente.
        Attualmente aperto a collaborazioni e progetti freelance.
      </p>
      <div class="about-meta">
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label" data-i18n="about.meta.university">Università</span>
          <span class="meta-value">UniPa — Ingegneria Informatica</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label" data-i18n="about.meta.year">Anno</span>
          <span class="meta-value">3°</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label" data-i18n="about.meta.location">Posizione</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Palermo, IT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label" data-i18n="about.meta.status">Status</span>
          <span class="meta-value meta-open">Open to work</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-body {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .meta-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--color-soft);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .meta-open {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
